@startuml
!include skin.iuml
skinparam stateBorderColor #444444
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #DCE6F2
skinparam stateArrowColor #444444
hide empty description
title Circuit breaker state machine (implemented with the State pattern)

[*] --> CLOSED
CLOSED --> CLOSED : success /\nreset failure count
CLOSED --> OPEN : failure and\nconsecutiveFailures >= threshold
OPEN --> OPEN : call rejected\n(CircuitOpenException, 503)
OPEN --> HALF_OPEN : openDuration elapsed\n(checked on next call)
HALF_OPEN --> CLOSED : all trial calls succeed
HALF_OPEN --> OPEN : any trial call fails
HALF_OPEN --> HALF_OPEN : trial permits (Semaphore)\nexhausted / reject extra calls

note left of CLOSED
  Every transition uses
  compare-and-set, so exactly
  one thread performs it.
end note
@enduml
